WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.437
Why does this matter?

2
00:00:01.437 --> 00:00:04.550
Group-based access survives
the move to Entra I D.

3
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:08.725
What changes is who keeps each group
current, and what stands in front of it.

4
00:00:08.725 --> 00:00:11.962
A group kept by hand from
the org chart becomes a rule.

5
00:00:11.962 --> 00:00:15.700
A group of named administrators
becomes an assigned group under pim.

6
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.550
And a distribution list
never becomes a login.

7
00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:23.114
In this module you take every Active
Directory group that reaches Sequel Server,

8
00:00:23.114 --> 00:00:25.225
and say which Entra group replaces it.
